/v1/","context":{"app_id":4656440,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4656440","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:24:39Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4656470","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4656440-1846651706691457","game_id":"steam-4656440","kind":"announcement","title":"Drum Incremental is in Steam Next Fest: play the free demo this week","summary":"Steam Next Fest is on until October 26 and the free demo of Drum Incremental is part of it. Phases 1 and 2: eight real percussion rudiments, golden notes that climb a major scale, the exam teacher with five faces, and an original soundtrack that follows your metronome.The full game (40 rudiments, 5 phases) launches November 2. If you play the demo this week, tell me where you got stuck in the \"Demo feedback\" forum: that's what I'm fixing before launch. And a wishlist helps more than anything. Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691457","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656440-1846651706682548","game_id":"steam-4656440","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch the free demo, then play it","summary":"This stream is recorded gameplay from the free demo, looping all week during Steam Next Fest: real drum rudiments on your mouse buttons, golden notes that climb a major scale, and the exam teacher who notices every miss.The demo is free on this page. The full game, with 40 rudiments and 5 phases, launches on November 2. If you like what you see, a wishlist helps more than anything. Thanks for watching!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:38:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682548","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656440-1846018067929234","game_id":"steam-4656440","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo is out, ahead of Steam Next Fest","summary":"The free demo of Drum Incremental is out now. Phases 1 and 2: eight real percussion rudiments to unlock and master, golden notes that climb a real major scale, the phase exam with the five-faced teacher (he runs the tutorial now too), and an original soundtrack that follows your metronome.It's also part of Steam Next Fest, October 19–26, and the full game (40 rudiments, 5 phases) launches November 2.Played it? Tell us what worked and what didn't in the \"Demo feedback\" forum, or on Discord. And i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T11:00:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929234","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656440-1845383656383385","game_id":"steam-4656440","kind":"announcement","title":"Launching November 2 — free demo at Steam Next Fest","summary":"We have a date!Drum Incremental launches on Steam on November 2, 2026. Before that, the free demo premieres at Steam Next Fest, October 19–26.What's in the demoThe first two phases: from a few nailed planks to your first real practice padReal percussion rudiments on your mouse buttons: left click is your left hand, right click your right handGolden notes that climb a real major scale as you catch themThe exam teacher, who now also guides you through the game (and gets impatient if you ignore him","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T18:02:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383385","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656440-1844751498230037","game_id":"steam-4656440","kind":"announcement","title":"New website + the teacher takes over","summary":"Two pieces of news this week.The official website is liveDrum Incremental now has a home at drumincremental.drumhazzard.net. You can play your first rudiments right in your browser, on desktop or phone: the Single Stroke Roll, the Double Stroke Roll and the Single Paradiddle, with the exam teacher watching every note. There's also a press kit for anyone who wants to write about the game.The teacher takes over the tutorialYou clearly like the exam teacher, so we gave him a bigger role: every tip ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T22:16:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230037","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656440-1842212951305312","game_id":"steam-4656440","kind":"announcement","title":"Launching November 2nd — demo at Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Drum Incremental launches November 2nd, and the free demo (Phases 1–2) premieres at Steam Next Fest, October 19–26. Between now and then I'll be posting clips and devlogs — TikTok/Bluesky @drumincremental, or join the Discord. If satisfying, rhythm-driven clicking sounds like your thing, add it to your wishlist — it helps this solo dev more than you know. 🥁","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T10:04:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305312","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656440-1832700592794206","game_id":"steam-4656440","kind":"update","title":"First Development Update","summary":"Hi! Welcome to the first development update for Drum Incremental. If you're here, I'm guessing you already know what the game is about. So let's get straight to it: Where are we? The gameplay is complete. All 40 rudiments, 5 phases, achievements, the metronome, the Study Companion... everything is working and polished. Right now we're working on two fronts in parallel: QA. Beta testers are still playing through and refining details. Nothing broken, but there's always something to improve. Final ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-16T10:56:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592794206","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4656440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:25Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:25Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4656440":"2026-10-26T03:18:25Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4656440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:25Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4656470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:25Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4656440","app_id":4656440,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:45Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"97cbafa203805802b2f39c2bae81456b82e3a219f54cf79d2d1ee4080043760e","response_sha256":null,"source_